00:01:32.130 --> 00:01:37.400
Now then, three years have gone by
 since you two made up again.

00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:39.400
Whassup, Kazuki?

00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:44.200
I've told you time and again to stop coming in through the veranda.

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:47.040
And I've told <i>you</i>
 to get used to it already.

00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:49.070
After all, we're a couple now.

00:01:52.350 --> 00:01:54.870
I'll never get used to it!

00:01:55.900 --> 00:02:01.580
Give me a break. I've been saying 
the same thing for the past three years.

00:02:02.890 --> 00:02:05.400
But I can't help it.

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:08.930
I can't help wanting to be like this with you as soon as possible.

00:02:08.930 --> 00:02:10.930
You dummy...

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:13.320
I love you, Kazuki.

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:16.320
Yuuji...

