00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:35.780
Onee-chan?

00:02:35.780 --> 00:02:38.580
Guess I'd better start working
 on episode eight.

00:02:39.150 --> 00:02:42.220
No wonder I was having
 a strange dream...

00:02:42.580 --> 00:02:46.220
Wait, what are you doing
 in my room this early?

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:49.630
You weren't waking up, 
so I wrote some diary entries.

00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:50.950
Or should I say...

00:02:51.360 --> 00:02:52.590
...memories of love?

00:02:52.590 --> 00:02:55.850
I think you've already escalated 
beyond diary levels.

00:02:55.850 --> 00:02:58.520
It's only been a week since the "incident."

00:02:58.520 --> 00:03:01.030
But you got a nice dream out of it, right?

00:03:01.030 --> 00:03:03.030
Way too implausible.

00:03:07.350 --> 00:03:11.910
Sure, we've made up, 
but he's far from out of the doghouse.

00:03:11.910 --> 00:03:15.090
Hmm? It's a hard-knock life for Yuuji-kun.

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:18.630
And here he got to act as a hug-pillow for the first time in weeks.

00:03:21.740 --> 00:03:24.010
I don't know when, but I fell asleep.

00:03:28.870 --> 00:03:31.980
It's every guy's fantasy to be this way!

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:34.720
Onee-chan, you unlocked it again?!

00:03:34.720 --> 00:03:36.820
Where's Marie-chan 
when you really need her?

00:03:39.040 --> 00:03:40.400
M-My apologies. 
I will eliminate him immediately.

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:42.400
M-My apologies. 
I will eliminate him immediately.

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:44.310
Kazuki!

00:03:45.090 --> 00:03:48.290
Ouch! No! Not the butt! Stop it!

00:03:49.850 --> 00:03:52.640
Everyone's a morning person today.

00:03:52.640 --> 00:03:55.500
Onee-chan, is that what you'd call this?

00:03:57.040 --> 00:03:57.960
My...

00:04:01.860 --> 00:04:03.430
So, where's Chihaya-chan?

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:07.550
She told me she'd be out sick 
with a cold today.

00:04:07.550 --> 00:04:10.050
Heh, what a wimp.

00:04:10.050 --> 00:04:13.540
Oh yeah... Hatsune-san!

00:04:13.540 --> 00:04:14.650
Yes?

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:17.150
This morning, I tasted failure.

00:04:17.910 --> 00:04:20.650
Ah, sorry about my sister.

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:24.280
Hatsune-oneesama is far too lenient
 with my brother.

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:27.350
We must find her weakness and stop her.

00:04:27.680 --> 00:04:30.860
Weakness? Do we really
 have to go that far?

00:04:30.860 --> 00:04:33.610
This morning, when I tried to stop him...

00:04:35.570 --> 00:04:37.630
She brought me down with one blow.

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:41.670
What do you two get up to
 behind my back?

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:44.090
What do you make of it, Kazuki-san?

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:49.130
Granted, it'd be nice if Onee-chan could dial it down a bit, but...

00:04:49.130 --> 00:04:51.520
Does she really have a weakness?

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:53.550
She's some kind of perfect person.

00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:55.350
Which means?

00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:57.310
First of all, she's popular with the guys. {And we all know that 's a measure of perfection}

00:04:57.310 --> 00:04:59.300
Good morning, Hatsune-san!

00:04:59.810 --> 00:05:01.280
Thank you very much.

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:03.590
By the way, that's her fan club.

00:05:03.590 --> 00:05:06.550
I never knew that it existed.

00:05:06.550 --> 00:05:09.900
Probably because they never
 do anything interesting.

00:05:09.900 --> 00:05:11.120
Arisaka-senpai!

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:13.410
Would you like to go out with me this Sunday?

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:16.200
Hey you! Club member #100!

00:05:16.200 --> 00:05:16.900
Yes!?

00:05:16.900 --> 00:05:19.040
How can you just casually ask her out?!

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:22.790
Watching over Hatsune-san
 from afar is our creed!

00:05:22.790 --> 00:05:25.100
Apologize to the world for your rudeness!

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:26.880
Show some manners, newcomer!

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:29.670
That's their "reality."

00:05:29.670 --> 00:05:32.560
An organization that manages to be both uninteresting and annoying.

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:36.180
At least their idol genuinely appreciates it.

00:05:36.180 --> 00:05:39.560
She says she likes it when people come to love her.

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:40.680
I see.

00:05:40.680 --> 00:05:43.530
It goes with the territory of having high charisma.

00:05:43.820 --> 00:05:47.720
She's not just charismatic, she's really smart too.

00:05:47.720 --> 00:05:51.440
She's got no shortage of 
athletic and artistic talents.

00:05:52.640 --> 00:05:54.490
What are you doing?!

00:05:54.490 --> 00:05:56.500
In order to find 
Hatsune-oneesama's weakness,

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:59.960
I will utilize this special piece of equipment and commence investigation.

00:06:08.110 --> 00:06:10.460
How'ya doin', Marie-chan?

00:06:10.860 --> 00:06:13.680
Isn't today another <i>good morning?</i>

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:16.390
You could at least say
 "How are you doing?", Neena-san.

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:20.900
Furthermore, I am not doing anything, nor am I Marie. I am merely a bush.

00:06:21.430 --> 00:06:24.250
Oh, you're ambushing someone?

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:26.150
Please do not talk to the bush.

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:26.650
Please do not talk to the bush.

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:27.600
Ta-da~a!

00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:33.650
So <i>silent talk</i> is okay?

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:36.440
<i>No!</i>

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:39.740
Wait up, Marie!

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:43.250
Neena-chan, you're saying everything out loud...

00:06:40.350 --> 00:06:43.250
Marie, wait wait wait!

00:06:47.230 --> 00:06:49.620
It's just as you said, Kazuki-san.

00:06:50.030 --> 00:06:55.600
Superior grades, master of arms and letters, and more popular than anyone else.

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:57.770
Certainly flawless.

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:01.980
Hatsune-san is looking 
straight at the camera in all of these.

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:03.940
That would probably be because 
she noticed Neena-san following me.

00:07:03.940 --> 00:07:06.480
That would probably be because 
she noticed Neena-san following me.

00:07:07.100 --> 00:07:10.120
That's part of it, but not the only part.

00:07:10.120 --> 00:07:15.130
At any rate, Hatsune-oneesama shows no weaknesses at school.

00:07:15.130 --> 00:07:17.660
Told you so. What's more,

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:22.030
she's great at housework, too.
 For instance, take this lunchbox...

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:26.120
Highly delicious.

00:07:26.120 --> 00:07:30.040
Of all the possibilities, I never thought you'd be looking for Hatsune-san's weakness.

00:07:30.350 --> 00:07:32.050
Aren't you curious?

00:07:32.400 --> 00:07:36.310
Well, there sure is a massive gap between her and her little sister.

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:40.930
Your cooking sucks, 
and you're fussy, sulky, violent...

00:07:41.490 --> 00:07:44.120
Well, Hatsune-san <i>is</i>
 only human, you know.

00:07:44.120 --> 00:07:47.620
If you keep looking, you're bound to find
 a weakness or two.

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:51.360
Do you have any idea what it could be?

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:54.050
Well, let's see... 
It might be something normal,

00:07:54.050 --> 00:07:55.490
Well, let's see... 
It might be something normal,

00:07:55.490 --> 00:07:57.110
like being scared of bugs. {somehow I originally transcribed this as "dogs"; self-projection, perhaps?}

00:07:57.510 --> 00:07:59.120
What's wrong? It's just a scarab.

00:07:59.120 --> 00:07:59.860
What's wrong? It's just a scarab.

00:07:59.860 --> 00:08:01.660
We used to catch them together, right?

00:07:59.860 --> 00:08:02.080
Wait, stop it,

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:05.130
No, go away! Marie-chan, help m-!

00:08:08.900 --> 00:08:11.550
N-No way...

00:08:11.940 --> 00:08:15.890
Stop! Don't! Please, get it off me!

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:17.350
Take it off!

00:08:17.350 --> 00:08:17.760
Take it off!

00:08:18.960 --> 00:08:22.560
I can't resist that expression! 
Here I come!

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:23.810
I can't resist that expression! 
Here I come!

00:08:25.460 --> 00:08:27.770
You should just buzz off too!

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:30.210
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:30.970
Welcome back...

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:37.230
Look, this scarab has
 wonderful copper-colored wings.

00:08:37.230 --> 00:08:38.740
S-Stop that!

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:39.070
S-Stop that!

00:08:39.070 --> 00:08:41.530
Aw, but it's so cute...

00:08:42.100 --> 00:08:44.200
Arisaka-senpai!

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:46.450
My, my, again today?

00:08:46.450 --> 00:08:50.100
Please, would you join
 the softball club today?

00:08:50.100 --> 00:08:51.630
Pick flower arrangement instead.

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:53.170
No, the tennis club.

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:54.450
The handicrafts club!

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:56.770
Those things wouldn't suit Senpai at all.

00:08:56.770 --> 00:08:59.050
Why's that!? Come on.

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:01.170
My, my, don't fight now.

00:09:01.570 --> 00:09:04.180
All right, Onee-sama!

00:09:01.570 --> 00:09:04.180
All right, Onee-sama!

00:09:04.180 --> 00:09:06.470
I'll go somewhere else for a while.

00:09:11.590 --> 00:09:14.520
Hatsune-oneesama is so popular that even the girls want her?

00:09:14.520 --> 00:09:16.940
Yes, very much.

00:09:16.940 --> 00:09:21.130
And once they noticed her talents, 
every club started pushing her to join.

00:09:21.130 --> 00:09:24.380
But she's always turned them down.

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:27.030
That must be very disheartening.

00:09:27.850 --> 00:09:29.750
Disheartening... Well...

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:33.730
I wish she would find 
something to devote herself to.

00:09:33.730 --> 00:09:38.780
She's very talented, but she wastes those talents teasing me every day.

00:09:38.780 --> 00:09:40.180
It's such a shame.

00:09:40.860 --> 00:09:43.380
I wonder why she won't do anything.

00:09:44.580 --> 00:09:49.510
Hatsune's thought processes are an eternal mystery to me.

00:09:49.960 --> 00:09:52.680
She really doesn't seem
 to have any weaknesses.

00:09:52.680 --> 00:09:55.610
Once again, we failed
 to convince her today.

00:09:55.610 --> 00:09:58.070
I guess her home life
 is more important to her.

00:09:58.070 --> 00:09:58.720
I guess her home life
 is more important to her.

00:09:58.720 --> 00:10:02.030
I heard that her parents 
recently went overseas.

00:10:02.720 --> 00:10:04.740
Maybe her family is just too much work.

00:10:04.740 --> 00:10:08.190
But she's amazing at housework, too!

00:10:08.190 --> 00:10:09.900
Do you think...

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:13.730
...that I could be the reason?

00:10:13.730 --> 00:10:16.700
Have I always been dead weight to her?

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:22.040
Arisaka-san!

00:10:24.240 --> 00:10:25.690
Got a minute?

00:10:25.690 --> 00:10:26.670
Yeah.

00:10:26.670 --> 00:10:29.540
I'm with the media club,
 and we can't find your sister.

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:31.370
Has she gone home already?

00:10:31.370 --> 00:10:33.190
Well, she <i>is</i> in the "go home" club.

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:35.810
Was there some place
 we forgot to check?

00:10:36.260 --> 00:10:39.100
Thank you. I'll try looking some more.

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:46.790
You'll never catch a thing 
with that attitude, let alone a cold!

00:10:50.100 --> 00:10:52.960
Hatsune-san collapsed from a cold. 
 If we're going to share her pain,

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:55.580
we have no choice but to 
catch a cold ourselves!

00:10:58.550 --> 00:11:00.290
Once more!

00:10:59.230 --> 00:11:02.100
Onee-chan... collapsed?

00:11:02.100 --> 00:11:03.720
...we can't find your sister...

00:11:11.690 --> 00:11:12.560
Onee-chan!

00:11:12.560 --> 00:11:14.840
What's wrong? You look pale.

00:11:14.840 --> 00:11:16.980
You didn't have club activities today?

00:11:16.980 --> 00:11:18.590
Where's Hatsune?

00:11:18.590 --> 00:11:21.080
She'd be preparing dinner...

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:22.660
Oh, welcome home!

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:26.240
You're home early.
 Are your club activities over already?

00:11:26.240 --> 00:11:29.360
Guess what, we're having
 Vietnamese food for dinner tonight...

00:11:28.860 --> 00:11:31.360
What the heck do you think you're doing!?

00:11:36.400 --> 00:11:38.550
I knew it. You have a slight fever.

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:40.530
Did you overwork yourself?

00:11:41.670 --> 00:11:47.050
I did stay up all last night watching 
you sleep and making entries in the diary. {s, rw}

00:11:47.050 --> 00:11:50.610
So much for <i>that</i> mystery. 
 Just get some rest for now.

00:11:50.610 --> 00:11:53.220
People who collapse from a cold shouldn't be doing housework!

00:11:53.220 --> 00:11:55.390
"Collapsed"? I did that?

00:11:55.390 --> 00:11:58.260
According to your fanboys, yes.

00:11:59.110 --> 00:12:03.070
I wouldn't say I "collapsed,"
 just that I tripped and fell...

00:12:03.070 --> 00:12:05.360
Leave everything in the house to me!

00:12:05.360 --> 00:12:08.400
Onee-chan, just relax and 
get some sleep, okay?

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:12.090
Kazuki-chan... I understand.

00:12:12.090 --> 00:12:13.040
Kazuki-chan... I understand.

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:14.360
Onee-chan!

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:35.050
I guess it is a slight cold.

00:12:35.540 --> 00:12:41.270
A little rest should have
 that cleared up in no time.

00:12:43.270 --> 00:12:45.410
And it's nice to act spoiled sometimes!

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:53.250
And so, I'll be filling in
 for my sister today!

00:12:54.850 --> 00:12:55.670
Cleaning!

00:12:57.180 --> 00:12:58.090
Laundry!

00:12:59.600 --> 00:13:00.550
Cooking!

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:04.540
Well, we wouldn't want
 to get in your way...

00:13:04.540 --> 00:13:06.220
Please excuse us.

00:13:07.110 --> 00:13:08.970
And where do you two
 think you're going!?{Where do you think you two you're going!?}

00:13:09.370 --> 00:13:13.700
It's just that we wanted
 to lighten your workload, so...

